WEBVTT

00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:30.704
A party with your friends on Halloween,

00:00:30.746 --> 00:00:34.704
without having to go through
all the trouble of finding a costume,

00:00:34.746 --> 00:00:39.121
a costume, mind you,
you'll never wear again.

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:41.371
Oh, you will be there.

00:00:41.412 --> 00:00:43.079
So Saturday is here.

00:00:43.121 --> 00:00:46.162
You head on over
in your favorite faded jeans

00:00:46.204 --> 00:00:48.537
and the stylish enough top,

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:51.496
quite frankly, you’ve been
lounging in all day.

00:00:52.162 --> 00:00:53.954
You knock on the door.

00:00:53.996 --> 00:00:56.579
Out steps these bright red boots,

00:00:56.621 --> 00:01:01.412
the perfect accessory
to your friend's Wonder Woman costume.